		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Auto Resume","zh":"自动恢复"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Automatically resume the most recent session in the current directory","zh":"自动恢复当前目录中最近的会话"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Sleep Prevention","zh":"防休眠"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Off","zh":"关闭"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Do not prevent any sleep","zh":"不阻止任何休眠"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Prevent Idle Sleep","zh":"阻止空闲休眠"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Prevent Display Sleep","zh":"阻止显示器休眠"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Prevent System Sleep","zh":"阻止系统休眠"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Enable Advisor","zh":"启用顾问"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Pair a second model (assigned to the 'advisor' role) that passively reviews each turn and injects notes.","zh":"配对第二个模型(分配给 'advisor' 角色),被动审查每一轮并在其中注入笔记。"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Enable Prewalk","zh":"启用 Prewalk"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Start on the active model, then switch to a fast/cheap model (default the 'smol' role) at the first edit/write after the plan nudge's todo list exists — the strong model plans, commits the todos, and starts the implementation before handing off. Overridable per session with --prewalk / --no-prewalk.","zh":"先在当前模型上开始,然后在计划提示的待办列表出现后的第一次编辑/写入时切换到快速/廉价模型(默认 'smol' 角色)——强模型负责规划、提交待办并开始实现,然后移交。可通过 --prewalk / --no-prewalk 按会话覆盖。"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Advisor Sync Backlog","zh":"顾问同步积压"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Pause the main agent for up to 30 seconds if the advisor falls behind by this many turns. Off disables catch-up delays.","zh":"当顾问落后这么多轮时,最多暂停主代理 30 秒。关闭则禁用追赶延迟。"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Advisor Immune Turns","zh":"顾问免打扰轮数"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"After an advisor concern or blocker interrupts, route further concerns/blockers non-interruptingly for this many primary turns.","zh":"在顾问的关切或阻塞中断之后,接下来的这么多主轮次内,后续关切/阻塞将以非中断方式传递。"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"0 turns","zh":"0 轮"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Allow every concern/blocker to interrupt.","zh":"允许每个关切/阻塞中断。"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"1 turn","zh":"1 轮"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"2 turns","zh":"2 轮"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"3 turns","zh":"3 轮"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Default.","zh":"默认。"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"4 turns","zh":"4 轮"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"5 turns","zh":"5 轮"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Enable Git Integration","zh":"启用 Git 集成"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Show git branch, status, and PR information in the TUI and watch repository metadata.","zh":"在 TUI 中显示 git 分支、状态和 PR 信息,并监听仓库元数据。"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Max In-Flight Requests","zh":"最大并发请求数"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Maximum concurrent LLM requests per provider id (for example \"openai\" or \"anthropic\"), shared across local OMP processes with this config root. Omitted providers are unlimited.","zh":"每个 provider id(例如 “openai” 或 “anthropic”)的最大并发 LLM 请求数,在使用此配置根的本地 OMP 进程之间共享。未列出的提供商不受限制。"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Model Role Storage","zh":"模型角色存储位置"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Where model selector role assignments are saved","zh":"模型选择器的角色分配保存在哪里"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Global","zh":"全局"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Save role models in the active profile config (current behavior)","zh":"将角色模型保存在当前 profile 配置中(当前行为)"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Per-project","zh":"按项目"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Save project role models in .omp/config.yml; missing project roles use global defaults","zh":"将项目角色模型保存在 .omp/config.yml 中;缺失的项目角色使用全局默认值"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Dark Theme","zh":"深色主题"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Theme used when the terminal has a dark background","zh":"终端为深色背景时使用的主题"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Light Theme","zh":"浅色主题"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Theme used when the terminal has a light background","zh":"终端为浅色背景时使用的主题"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Symbol Preset","zh":"符号预设"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Glyph set for icons and symbols (Unicode, Nerd Font, or ASCII)","zh":"图标和符号使用的字形集(Unicode、Nerd Font 或 ASCII)"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Standard symbols (default)","zh":"标准符号(默认)"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Requires Nerd Font","zh":"需要 Nerd Font"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Maximum compatibility","zh":"最大兼容性"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Color-Blind Mode","zh":"色盲模式"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Use blue instead of green for diff additions","zh":"diff 新增内容使用蓝色而不是绿色"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Status Line Preset","zh":"状态栏预设"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Pre-built status line configurations","zh":"预置的状态栏配置"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Default","zh":"默认"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Model, path, git, context, tokens, cost","zh":"模型、路径、git、上下文、tokens、费用"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Minimal","zh":"极简"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Path and git only","zh":"仅路径和 git"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Compact","zh":"紧凑"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Model, git, cost, context","zh":"模型、git、费用、上下文"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Full","zh":"完整"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"All segments including time","zh":"包括时间在内的所有分段"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Maximum info with Nerd Font icons","zh":"使用 Nerd Font 图标显示最多信息"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"No special characters","zh":"无特殊字符"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Custom","zh":"自定义"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"User-defined segments","zh":"用户自定义分段"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Status Line Separator","zh":"状态栏分隔符"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Style of separators between segments","zh":"分段之间分隔符的样式"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Solid arrows (Nerd Font)","zh":"实心箭头(Nerd Font)"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Thin chevron","zh":"细箭头"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Thin arrows (Nerd Font)","zh":"细箭头(Nerd Font)"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Slash","zh":"斜杠"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Forward slashes","zh":"正斜杠"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Pipe","zh":"竖线"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Vertical pipes","zh":"垂直竖线"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Block","zh":"方块"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Solid blocks","zh":"实心方块"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"None","zh":"无"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Space only","zh":"仅空格"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Greater-than signs","zh":"大于号"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Session Accent","zh":"会话强调色"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Use the session name color for the editor border and status line gap","zh":"使用会话名称的颜色作为编辑器边框和状态栏间隙的颜色"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Transparent Status Line","zh":"透明状态栏"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Use the terminal's default background for the status line instead of the theme's `statusLineBg`. Powerline end caps are dropped because they need a contrasting fill to bridge into the surrounding terminal.","zh":"状态栏使用终端的默认背景,而不是主题的 `statusLineBg`。Powerline 端帽会被去掉,因为它们需要对比色填充来衔接周围终端。"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Compact Thinking Level","zh":"紧凑思考级别"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Show the thinking level as a single icon on the model name instead of a separate ` · <level>` suffix.","zh":"在模型名称上以单个图标显示思考级别,而不是单独的 ` · <level>` 后缀。"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Artifact Spill Threshold (KB)","zh":"Artifact 溢出阈值 (KB)"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Tool output above this size is saved as an artifact; tail is kept inline","zh":"超过此大小的工具输出保存为 artifact;尾部保留在内联"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"~250 tokens","zh":"约 250 tokens"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"~625 tokens","zh":"约 625 tokens"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"~1.25K tokens","zh":"约 1.25K tokens"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"~2.5K tokens","zh":"约 2.5K tokens"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"~5K tokens","zh":"约 5K tokens"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"~7.5K tokens","zh":"约 7.5K tokens"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Default; ~12.5K tokens","zh":"默认;约 12.5K tokens"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"~19K tokens","zh":"约 19K tokens"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"~25K tokens","zh":"约 25K tokens"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"~50K tokens","zh":"约 50K tokens"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"~125K tokens","zh":"约 125K tokens"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"~250K tokens","zh":"约 250K tokens"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Artifact Tail Size (KB)","zh":"Artifact 尾部大小 (KB)"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Amount of tail content kept inline when output spills to artifact","zh":"输出溢出到 artifact 时保留在内联的尾部内容量"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Default; ~5K tokens","zh":"默认;约 5K tokens"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"~12.5K tokens","zh":"约 12.5K tokens"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Artifact Head Size (KB)","zh":"Artifact 头部大小 (KB)"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Amount of head content kept inline alongside the tail when output spills to artifact (middle elision). 0 disables — keep tail only.","zh":"输出溢出到 artifact 时,与尾部一起保留在内联的头部内容量(中间省略)。0 表示禁用——只保留尾部。"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Disabled; tail-only truncation","zh":"已禁用;仅截断尾部"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Output Column Cap","zh":"输出列数上限"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Per-line byte cap for streaming tool outputs (bash, python, js eval) and `read`. Lines wider than this are ellipsis-truncated; remaining bytes up to the next newline are dropped. 0 disables.","zh":"流式工具输出(bash、python、js eval)和 `read` 的每行字节上限。超过此宽度的行以省略号截断;到下一个换行符为止的剩余字节被丢弃。0 表示禁用。"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"No per-line cap","zh":"无每行上限"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Tight","zh":"紧凑"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Loose","zh":"宽松"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Artifact Tail Lines","zh":"Artifact 尾部行数"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Maximum lines of tail content kept inline when output spills to artifact","zh":"输出溢出到 artifact 时保留在内联的尾部内容最大行数"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"50 lines","zh":"50 行"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"100 lines","zh":"100 行"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"~500 tokens","zh":"约 500 tokens"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"250 lines","zh":"250 行"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"500 lines","zh":"500 行"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Default; ~2.5K tokens","zh":"默认;约 2.5K tokens"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"1000 lines","zh":"1000 行"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"2000 lines","zh":"2000 行"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"~10K tokens","zh":"约 10K tokens"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"5000 lines","zh":"5000 行"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Show Hook Status","zh":"显示 Hook 状态"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Display hook status messages below the status line","zh":"在状态栏下方显示 hook 状态消息"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Show Inline Images","zh":"显示内联图片"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Render images inline in the terminal","zh":"在终端中内联渲染图片"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Auto-Resize Images","zh":"自动调整图片大小"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Resize large images to 2000x2000 max for better model compatibility","zh":"将大图片调整为最大 2000x2000,以获得更好的模型兼容性"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Block Images","zh":"阻止图片"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Prevent images from being sent to LLM providers","zh":"阻止图片发送给 LLM 提供商"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Describe Images for Text Models","zh":"为文本模型描述图片"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"When an image is attached to a model without vision support, save it under local:// and inject a description from a vision-capable model instead of dropping it","zh":"当图片附加到不支持视觉的模型时,将其保存在 local:// 下,并注入来自支持视觉模型的描述,而不是丢弃它"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Maximum width in terminal columns for inline images (default 100). Set to 0 for unlimited (bounded only by terminal width).","zh":"内联图片的最大宽度(终端列数,默认 100)。设为 0 表示不限(仅受终端宽度限制)。"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Maximum height in terminal rows for inline images (default 20). Set to 0 to use only the viewport-based limit (60% of terminal height).","zh":"内联图片的最大高度(终端行数,默认 20)。设为 0 则仅使用基于视口的限制(终端高度的 60%)。"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Maximum number of inline images kept as live terminal graphics (default 8). Older images fall back to a text placeholder via a full redraw once the limit is exceeded. Set to 0 to keep every image (no limit).","zh":"作为实时终端图形保留的内联图片最大数量(默认 8)。超过限制后,较旧的图片通过完全重绘回退为文本占位符。设为 0 表示保留所有图片(无限制)。"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Native Terminal Progress","zh":"原生终端进度"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Emit OSC 9;4 indeterminate progress while the agent or context maintenance is running","zh":"在代理或上下文维护运行时发出 OSC 9;4 不确定进度"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Large Headings (Kitty)","zh":"大标题 (Kitty)"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Render Markdown H1 headings at 2x scale using Kitty's OSC 66 text-sizing protocol. Only takes effect on Kitty terminals; ignored everywhere else. Off by default.","zh":"使用 Kitty 的 OSC 66 文本尺寸协议以 2 倍大小渲染 Markdown H1 标题。仅在 Kitty 终端上生效;其他终端忽略。默认关闭。"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Render Mermaid Diagrams","zh":"渲染 Mermaid 图表"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Render Mermaid fenced code blocks as ASCII diagrams","zh":"将 Mermaid 围栏代码块渲染为 ASCII 图表"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Codex Reset Fireworks","zh":"Codex 重置烟花"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Celebrate unscheduled Codex weekly usage resets and newly banked saved resets with a top-third fireworks overlay that remains until Escape","zh":"用屏幕上方三分之一处的烟花覆盖层庆祝计划外的 Codex 每周用量重置和新存入的保存重置,直到按下 Escape 才消失"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Terminal Title Run State","zh":"终端标题运行状态"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Show the agent run state in the terminal title's separator — an animated spinner while working (a static ':' on Windows), '>' when it's your turn, '!' when the agent is waiting on you","zh":"在终端标题的分隔符中显示代理运行状态——工作时为动画旋转指示器(Windows 上是静态 ':' ),轮到你时显示 '>',代理等待你时显示 '!'"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Terminal Hyperlinks","zh":"终端超链接"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Wrap paths and URLs in OSC 8 hyperlinks for terminal-native click-to-open (auto: detect support; off: never; always: unconditional)","zh":"将路径和 URL 包装为 OSC 8 超链接,以便终端原生点击打开(auto: 检测支持;off: 从不;always: 无条件)"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Tight Layout","zh":"紧凑布局"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Remove the 1-character horizontal padding from the left and right of the terminal output","zh":"移除终端输出左右两侧 1 字符的水平内边距"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Shimmer","zh":"微光动画"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Animation style for working/loading messages","zh":"工作/加载消息的动画样式"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Classic","zh":"经典"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Soft cosine wave sweeping across the text","zh":"柔和余弦波扫过文本"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"KITT Scanner","zh":"KITT 扫描灯"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Knight Rider 1982 red light bouncing left-right","zh":"Knight Rider 1982 红色指示灯左右弹跳"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Disabled","zh":"已禁用"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"No animation; static muted text","zh":"无动画;静态弱化文本"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Smooth Streaming","zh":"平滑流式输出"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Reveal assistant text and streamed tool input smoothly while chunks arrive","zh":"在数据块到达时平滑地显示助手文本和流式工具输入"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Hide Tool Activity","zh":"隐藏工具活动"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Hide model-initiated tool calls and results from the transcript","zh":"在记录中隐藏模型发起的工具调用和结果"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Show Token Usage","zh":"显示 Token 用量"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Show per-turn token usage on assistant messages","zh":"在助手消息上显示每轮 token 用量"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Cache Miss Marker","zh":"缓存未命中标记"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Collapse Compacted History","zh":"折叠压缩历史"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Collapse pre-compaction history behind the summary divider on the live transcript; disable to keep the full transcript inline with dividers at each compaction point","zh":"在实时记录中,将压缩前的历史折叠到摘要分隔线之后;禁用则保留完整记录,并在每个压缩点显示分隔线"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Show Hardware Cursor","zh":"显示硬件光标"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Show terminal cursor for IME support","zh":"为 IME 支持显示终端光标"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"IME-Safe Prompt Layout","zh":"IME 安全提示行布局"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Move the prompt's bottom border to a separate row so macOS IME preedit cannot displace it","zh":"将提示行的底部边框移到单独一行,以免 macOS IME 预编辑将其挤开"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Thinking Level","zh":"思考级别"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Reasoning depth for thinking-capable models","zh":"支持思考的模型的推理深度"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Hide Thinking Blocks","zh":"隐藏思考块"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Hide thinking blocks in assistant responses","zh":"在助手回复中隐藏思考块"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Prose Only Thinking","zh":"仅正文思考"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Omit code blocks from thinking summaries and replace them with an ellipsis","zh":"从思考摘要中省略代码块,并用省略号替换"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Omit Thinking summaries","zh":"省略思考摘要"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Instruct upstream providers to completely omit thinking summaries from responses (where supported)","zh":"指示上游提供商完全省略响应中的思考摘要(在支持的情况下)"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Loop Guard","zh":"循环防护"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Enable automatic stream loop detection for model reasoning and prose","zh":"为模型推理和正文启用自动流循环检测"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Loop Guard Scan Prose","zh":"循环防护扫描正文"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Apply loop guard to assistant prose messages in addition to thinking logs","zh":"除思考日志外,也将循环防护应用于助手正文消息"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Loop Guard Tool-Call Reminder","zh":"循环防护工具调用提醒"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"When a Gemini reasoning stream emits many consecutive planning headers without calling a tool, interrupt it and inject a reminder to issue a tool call (requires Loop Guard)","zh":"当 Gemini 推理流连续发出多个规划头却不调用工具时,中断它并注入一条提醒,要求其发出工具调用(需要启用循环防护)"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Tool-Call Loop Guard","zh":"工具调用循环防护"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Detect consecutive identical tool calls across turns and inject a corrective steer","zh":"检测跨轮次的连续相同工具调用,并注入纠正性引导"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Tool-Call Loop Threshold","zh":"工具调用循环阈值"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Consecutive identical tool calls required before the corrective steer is injected","zh":"触发纠正性引导所需的连续相同工具调用次数"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Tool-Call Loop Exempt Tools","zh":"工具调用循环豁免工具"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Tool names that may repeat consecutively without triggering the cross-turn loop guard","zh":"允许连续重复而不会触发跨轮次循环防护的工具名称"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Inline Tool Descriptors","zh":"内联工具描述符"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Render full tool descriptors in the system prompt and strip top-level/nested descriptions from provider tool schemas so descriptor text is sent once. Auto enables this for Gemini models and disables it otherwise","zh":"在系统提示中渲染完整工具描述符,并从提供商工具 schema 中剥离顶层/嵌套描述,使描述文本只发送一次。Auto 对 Gemini 模型启用此功能,其他情况禁用"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Auto","zh":"自动"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Inline descriptors for Gemini models; keep them in tool schemas otherwise","zh":"对 Gemini 模型内联描述符;其他情况保留在工具 schema 中"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"On","zh":"开启"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Always inline descriptors in the system prompt","zh":"始终在系统提示中内联描述符"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Keep descriptors in provider tool schemas only","zh":"仅将描述符保留在提供商工具 schema 中"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Include Model in Prompt","zh":"在提示中显示模型"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Surface the active model identifier in the system prompt so the agent knows which model it is","zh":"在系统提示中显示当前模型标识,让代理知道自己使用的是哪个模型"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Include Workspace Tree","zh":"包含工作区目录树"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Render the workspace directory tree in the system prompt. WARNING: This can bust prompt caching across sessions when files are modified.","zh":"在系统提示中渲染工作区目录树。警告:文件被修改时,这可能会破坏跨会话的 prompt 缓存。"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Additional Workspace Dirs","zh":"附加工作区目录"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Extra workspace directories added to every session as additional roots (multi-root workspace). Managed live via /add-dir and /remove-dir. Paths resolve relative to cwd; absolute paths recommended. The agent is told these roots exist and can read/grep/glob them.","zh":"作为附加根目录加入每个会话的额外工作区目录(多根工作区)。可通过 /add-dir 和 /remove-dir 实时管理。路径相对于 cwd 解析;建议使用绝对路径。代理会被告知这些根目录存在,并可以 read/grep/glob 它们。"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Personality","zh":"个性"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Communication style rendered into the system prompt's personality block","zh":"渲染到系统提示个性块中的沟通风格"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Terse, evidence-first engineer; dense, action-oriented replies","zh":"简洁、以证据为先的工程师;信息密集、面向行动的回复"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Friendly","zh":"友好"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Warm, encouraging collaborator focused on momentum and morale","zh":"温暖、鼓励的协作者,注重推进动力和士气"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Pragmatic","zh":"务实"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Direct, efficient engineer focused on clarity and rigor","zh":"直接、高效的工程师,注重清晰和严谨"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Omit the personality block entirely","zh":"完全省略个性块"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Temperature","zh":"温度"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Sampling temperature (0 = deterministic, 1 = creative, -1 = provider default)","zh":"采样温度(0 = 确定性,1 = 创造性,-1 = 提供商默认)"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Use provider default","zh":"使用提供商默认值"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Deterministic","zh":"确定性"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Focused","zh":"聚焦"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Balanced","zh":"均衡"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Creative","zh":"创造性"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Maximum variety","zh":"最大多样性"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Nucleus sampling cutoff (0-1, -1 = provider default)","zh":"核采样截断值 (0-1,-1 = 提供商默认)"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Very focused","zh":"非常聚焦"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Broad","zh":"广泛"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"No nucleus filtering","zh":"无核过滤"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Sample from top-K tokens (-1 = provider default)","zh":"从 top-K tokens 中采样 (-1 = 提供商默认)"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Greedy top token","zh":"贪心最高 token"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Minimum probability threshold (0-1, -1 = provider default)","zh":"最小概率阈值 (0-1,-1 = 提供商默认)"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Very permissive","zh":"非常宽松"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Strict","zh":"严格"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Presence Penalty","zh":"存在惩罚"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Penalty for introducing already-present tokens (-1 = provider default)","zh":"对引入已存在 token 的惩罚 (-1 = 提供商默认)"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"No penalty","zh":"无惩罚"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Mild novelty","zh":"轻度新颖"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Encourage novelty","zh":"鼓励新颖"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Strong novelty","zh":"强烈新颖"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Repetition Penalty","zh":"重复惩罚"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Penalty for repeated tokens (-1 = provider default)","zh":"对重复 token 的惩罚 (-1 = 提供商默认)"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Allow repetition","zh":"允许重复"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Mild penalty","zh":"轻度惩罚"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Strong penalty","zh":"强烈惩罚"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Text Verbosity","zh":"文本详细程度"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"OpenAI Responses and Codex response verbosity (low, medium, or high)","zh":"OpenAI Responses 和 Codex 的响应详细程度(low、medium 或 high)"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Low","zh":"低"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Prefer concise responses","zh":"偏好简洁的回复"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Medium","zh":"中"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Balance brevity and detail (default)","zh":"在简洁与详细之间平衡(默认)"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"High","zh":"高"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Prefer detailed responses","zh":"偏好详细的回复"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Service Tier — OpenAI","zh":"服务层级 — OpenAI"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Processing tier for OpenAI / OpenAI-Codex requests, and OpenAI-family models routed via OpenRouter (none = omit). Sent as `service_tier`.","zh":"OpenAI / OpenAI-Codex 请求以及经由 OpenRouter 路由的 OpenAI 系模型的处理层级(none = 省略)。以 `service_tier` 字段发送。"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Service Tier — Anthropic","zh":"服务层级 — Anthropic"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Processing tier for Claude requests. `priority` realizes fast mode (`speed: \"fast\"`) on supported direct Anthropic models; ignored on Bedrock/Vertex Claude and via OpenRouter.","zh":"Claude 请求的处理层级。`priority` 在受支持的直接 Anthropic 模型上实现快速模式(`speed: “fast”`);在 Bedrock/Vertex Claude 和经由 OpenRouter 时被忽略。"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Service Tier — Google","zh":"服务层级 — Google"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Processing tier for Gemini (Google AI Studio + Vertex) requests, and Google-family models routed via OpenRouter (none = omit). Sent as the top-level `serviceTier` field.","zh":"Gemini(Google AI Studio + Vertex)请求以及经由 OpenRouter 路由的 Google 系模型的处理层级(none = 省略)。作为顶层 `serviceTier` 字段发送。"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Service Tier — Subagent","zh":"服务层级 — 子代理"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Service Tier for spawned task/eval subagents. Inherit = match the main agent's live per-family tiers (tracks /fast); pick a value to apply it to whichever family the subagent's model belongs to.","zh":"派生的 task/eval 子代理的服务层级。Inherit = 匹配主代理当前的各家族层级(跟随 /fast);选择某个值则将其应用于子代理模型所属的家族。"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Service Tier — Advisor","zh":"服务层级 — 顾问"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Service Tier for the advisor model. None = standard processing; Inherit = match the main agent's live per-family tiers; pick a value to apply it to the advisor model's family.","zh":"顾问模型的服务层级。None = 标准处理;Inherit = 匹配主代理当前的各家族层级;选择某个值则将其应用于顾问模型所属的家族。"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Retry Attempts","zh":"重试次数"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Maximum retry attempts on API errors","zh":"API 错误时的最大重试次数"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"1 retry","zh":"1 次重试"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"2 retries","zh":"2 次重试"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"3 retries","zh":"3 次重试"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"5 retries","zh":"5 次重试"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"10 retries","zh":"10 次重试"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Max Retry Delay","zh":"最大重试延迟"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Maximum wait between retries, in ms. When the provider asks us to wait longer than this and no credential or model fallback succeeds, the request fails fast instead of sleeping (e.g. 3-hour Anthropic rate-limit windows). 0 disables the ceiling — to let the session auto-resume through provider-stated quota resets.","zh":"重试之间的最大等待时间（毫秒）。当提供商要求等待更久且无凭据或模型回退可用时，请求将快速失败而不是休眠等待（如 3 小时的 Anthropic 限流窗口）。0 表示不设上限——让会话通过提供商声明的配额重置自动恢复。"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Retry Model Fallback","zh":"重试模型回退"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Allow retry recovery to switch to configured fallback models","zh":"允许重试恢复切换到已配置的回退模型"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Usage-Aware Fallback","zh":"用量感知回退"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Use reliable coding-plan quota reports to prefer same-provider accounts, then configured fallback models, before a hard usage limit. Ordinary configured API keys are excluded.","zh":"在达到硬用量限制之前,使用可靠的 coding-plan 配额报告优先选择同提供商的账户,然后是已配置的回退模型。普通的已配置 API keys 不在考虑范围内。"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Reserve Margin","zh":"预留余量"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Treat a coding-plan model as near its limit below this remaining percentage. Unknown or unmapped usage keeps the primary model.","zh":"当剩余百分比低于此值时,将 coding-plan 模型视为接近上限。未知或未映射的用量保持主模型不变。"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Act only when nearly exhausted","zh":"仅在几乎耗尽时触发"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Balanced safety margin","zh":"均衡的安全余量"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Conservative","zh":"保守"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Early protection","zh":"早期保护"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Very conservative","zh":"非常保守"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Reserve Policy","zh":"预留策略"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"What to do when every same-provider coding-plan account is inside the reserve margin.","zh":"当所有同提供商的 coding-plan 账户都处于预留余量之内时该怎么做。"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Confirm interactively","zh":"交互式确认"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Keep interactive sessions on the primary until confirmed; background agents auto-fallback","zh":"在确认前让交互会话保持使用主账户;后台代理自动回退"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Auto-fallback","zh":"自动回退"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Always select the next eligible configured fallback","zh":"始终选择下一个符合条件的已配置回退"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Fail closed","zh":"安全失败"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Do not spend reserve quota or select a fallback","zh":"不消耗预留配额,也不选择回退"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Retry Fallback Chains","zh":"重试回退链"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"JSON object mapping model roles, model selectors (\"provider/model-id\"), or provider wildcards (\"provider/*\") to ordered fallback selectors, e.g. {\"default\":[\"openai/gpt-4o-mini\"],\"google-antigravity/*\":[\"google/*\",\"google-vertex/*\"]}. Model-oriented keys apply whenever that model/provider is active, regardless of role; a \"provider/*\" entry keeps the failing model\\'s id and swaps the provider. An id-prefixed wildcard (\"openrouter/google/*\") re-prefixes the failing model\\'s bare id (google-antigravity/gemini-x -> openrouter/google/gemini-x) and, used as a key, matches only that provider\\'s ids under the prefix.","zh":"将模型角色、模型选择器(“provider/model-id”)或提供商通配符(“provider/*”)映射到有序回退选择器的 JSON 对象,例如 {\"default\":[\"openai/gpt-4o-mini\"],\"google-antigravity/*\":[\"google/*\",\"google-vertex/*\"]}。面向模型的键在该模型/提供商处于活跃状态时生效,与角色无关;“provider/*”条目保留失败模型的 id 并更换提供商。带 id 前缀的通配符(“openrouter/google/*”)会重新加上失败模型裸 id 的前缀(google-antigravity/gemini-x -> openrouter/google/gemini-x),用作键时只匹配该前缀下的该提供商 id。"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Fallback Revert Policy","zh":"回退还原策略"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"When to return to the primary model after a fallback","zh":"回退后何时返回主模型"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Cooldown expiry","zh":"冷却期结束"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Return to the primary model after its suppression window ends","zh":"抑制窗口结束后返回主模型"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Never","zh":"从不"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Stay on the fallback model until manually changed","zh":"一直使用回退模型,直到手动更改"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Anthropic Server-Side Fallback (Fable 5)","zh":"Anthropic 服务端回退 (Fable 5)"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"When a Claude Fable 5 / Mythos 5 request is blocked by Anthropic's safety classifier, retry it on Claude Opus 4.8 server-side (Anthropic `server-side-fallback-2026-06-01` beta). Opt-in — leaving this off preserves the pre-fallback behavior for every request.","zh":"当 Claude Fable 5 / Mythos 5 请求被 Anthropic 的安全分类器阻止时,在 Claude Opus 4.8 服务端重试(Anthropic `server-side-fallback-2026-06-01` beta)。需自行开启——保持关闭即为每个请求保留回退前的行为。"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Steering Mode","zh":"引导模式"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"How to process queued messages while agent is working","zh":"代理工作时如何处理排队消息"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Follow-Up Mode","zh":"跟进模式"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"How to drain follow-up messages after a turn completes","zh":"一轮完成后如何处理积压的跟进消息"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Interrupt Mode","zh":"中断模式"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"When steering messages interrupt tool execution","zh":"引导消息何时中断工具执行"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Loop Mode","zh":"循环模式"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"What happens between /loop iterations before re-submitting the prompt","zh":"/loop 迭代之间、重新提交提示之前会发生什么"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Re-submit the prompt as a follow-up message (current behavior)","zh":"将提示作为跟进消息重新提交(当前行为)"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Compact the session context, then re-submit the prompt","zh":"压缩会话上下文,然后重新提交提示"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Reset","zh":"重置"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Start a new session, then re-submit the prompt","zh":"开启新会话,然后重新提交提示"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Double-Escape Action","zh":"双击 Escape 操作"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Session Tree Filter","zh":"会话树过滤器"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Default filter mode when opening the session tree","zh":"打开会话树时的默认过滤模式"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Autocomplete Items","zh":"自动补全条目数"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Max visible items in autocomplete dropdown (3-20)","zh":"自动补全下拉菜单中最多可见的条目数 (3-20)"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"3 items","zh":"3 项"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"5 items","zh":"5 项"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"7 items","zh":"7 项"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"10 items","zh":"10 项"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"15 items","zh":"15 项"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"20 items","zh":"20 项"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Emoji Autocomplete","zh":"Emoji 自动补全"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Suggest emojis from `:name:` shortcodes and expand text emoticons like `:D` or `:-)`","zh":"从 `:name:` 短代码建议 emoji,并展开 `:D` 或 `:-)` 之类的文本表情"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Large Paste Menu","zh":"大段粘贴菜单"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"When a paste reaches this many lines, offer a menu to wrap it in a code block, wrap it in XML tags, or save it to a file. 0 disables the menu (large pastes still collapse to a [Paste] marker).","zh":"当粘贴内容达到这么多行时,提供菜单将其包裹在代码块中、包裹在 XML 标签中,或保存到文件。0 禁用该菜单(大段粘贴仍会折叠为 [Paste] 标记)。"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Quiet Startup","zh":"安静启动"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Skip welcome screen and startup status messages","zh":"跳过欢迎界面和启动状态消息"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Show Startup Splash","zh":"显示启动画面"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Show the full animated setup splash on normal interactive startup without rerunning setup. Quiet Startup still suppresses it.","zh":"在正常的交互式启动时显示完整的动画设置画面,而不重新运行设置。安静启动仍会抑制它。"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Setup Wizard","zh":"设置向导"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Show newly added onboarding steps once per setup version","zh":"每个设置版本显示一次新增的引导步骤"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Check for Updates","zh":"检查更新"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Check for omp updates on startup","zh":"启动时检查 omp 更新"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Marketplace Auto-Update","zh":"插件市场自动更新"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Check for plugin updates on startup","zh":"启动时检查插件更新"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Don't check for plugin updates","zh":"不检查插件更新"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Notify","zh":"通知"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Check on startup and notify when updates are available","zh":"启动时检查,有更新时通知"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Check on startup and auto-install updates","zh":"启动时检查并自动安装更新"},
