		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Choose whether update notes start as a summary, full details, or stay hidden","zh":"选择更新说明以摘要、完整详情开始,还是保持隐藏"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Summary","zh":"摘要"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Show release and change counts with a /changelog hint","zh":"显示发布和更改数量,并附带 /changelog 提示"},
