		{"kind":"string","file":"src/config/settings-schema.ts","en":"Off, local summary pipeline, Mnemopi SQLite, Hindsight remote memory, or Sharpshooter","zh":"关闭、本地摘要管线、Mnemopi SQLite、Hindsight 远程记忆或 Sharpshooter"},
